# Check modules

- One module = one file in `src/lib/checks/`
- Export `runXxxCheck(serverId): Promise<CheckResult>`
- Use `getSshClient()` – never shell out directly from components
- Return structured `CheckResult` with `status`, `data`, `alerts`, optional `recommendations`
- Compare snapshots via `src/lib/history/` for diffs (ports, SSH keys, users, containers)
- Persist via shared `persistCheckRun()` after each run

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD
export async function runRaidCheck(serverId: string): Promise<CheckResult> {
  const { stdout } = await ssh.exec("cat /proc/mdstat");
  return parseMdstat(stdout);
}
```
